{"id":371,"flavor":[{"games":["Shield"],"text":"Bagon is a solitary Pokémon that doesn’t form groups with others of its kind. It also has a head hard enough to cleave a boulder in one strike."},{"games":["Sword"],"text":"Bagon jumps off cliffs every day, trying to grow stronger so that someday it will be able to fly."},{"games":["Ultra Moon"],"text":"Some theories suggest that its behavior of forcefully bashing its head into things stimulates cells that affect its evolution."},{"games":["Ultra Sun"],"text":"Whenever it sees bird Pokémon flying through the sky, it becomes envious and smashes its surroundings to bits with headbutts."},{"games":["Moon"],"text":"With its steel-hard stone head, it headbutts indiscriminately. This is because of the stress it feels at being unable to fly."},{"games":["Sun"],"text":"Its belief that it will be able to fly one day is apparently the influence of information carried in its genes."},{"games":["Alpha Sapphire","Sapphire"],"text":"Bagon harbors a never-ending dream of one day soaring high among the clouds. As if trying to dispel its frustration over its inability to fly, this Pokémon slams its hard head against huge rocks and shatters them into pebbles."},{"games":["Omega Ruby","Ruby"],"text":"Bagon has a dream of one day soaring in the sky. In doomed efforts to fly, this Pokémon hurls itself off cliffs. As a result of its dives, its head has grown tough and as hard as tempered steel."},{"games":["Y","White 2","Black 2","White","Black","Platinum","Pearl","Diamond"],"text":"Dreaming of one day flying, it practices by leaping off cliffs every day."},{"games":["X","SoulSilver","HeartGold"],"text":"Its well-developed neck muscles and iron-like head can smash boulders into pieces."},{"games":["LeafGreen","FireRed"],"text":"Its steel-hard head can shatter boulders. It longingly hopes for wings to grow so it can fly."},{"games":["Emerald"],"text":"Although it is small, this POKéMON is very powerful because its body is a bundle of muscles. It launches head-butts with its ironlike skull."}],"abilities":[{"name":"Rock Head","hidden":false,"description":"Protects the Pokémon from recoil damage."},{"name":"Sheer Force","hidden":true,"description":"Removes any additional effects from the Pokémon's moves, but increases the moves' power."}],"eggGroups":["Dragon"],"genderRate":4,"hatchCounter":40,"baseHappiness":35,"growthRate":"slow","habitat":"rough terrain","color":"Blue","shape":"Humanoid","evolution":{"id":371,"name":"Bagon","condition":null,"children":[{"id":372,"name":"Shelgon","condition":"Lv. 30","children":[{"id":373,"name":"Salamence","condition":"Lv. 50","children":[]}]}]},"moves":{"game":"Scarlet / Violet","level":[[1,43],[1,52],[5,44],[10,225],[15,29],[20,184],[25,242],[31,337],[35,428],[40,116],[45,53],[50,200],[55,38]],"machine":[34,280,242,38,434,913,337,349,406,525,203,263,126,424,83,53,270,56,304,334,442,189,200,182,240,156,46,157,317,184,421,214,164,241,36,851,422,428],"egg":[111,407,37,239],"tutor":[]},"cards":[{"id":"sv9-112","name":"Bagon","set":"Journey Together","date":"2025-03-28","rarity":"Common","number":"112","artist":null,"img":"sv9/112"},{"id":"swsh7-107","name":"Bagon","set":"Evolving Skies","date":"2021-08-27","rarity":"Common","number":"107","artist":"ryoma uratsuka","img":"swsh7/107"},{"id":"sm75-42","name":"Bagon","set":"Dragon Majesty","date":"2018-09-07","rarity":"Common","number":"42","artist":"Kouki Saitou","img":"sm75/42"},{"id":"sm7-103","name":"Bagon","set":"Celestial Storm","date":"2018-08-03","rarity":"Common","number":"103","artist":"Yumi","img":"sm7/103"},{"id":"sm7-104","name":"Bagon","set":"Celestial Storm","date":"2018-08-03","rarity":"Common","number":"104","artist":"sui","img":"sm7/104"},{"id":"xy6-54","name":"Bagon","set":"Roaring Skies","date":"2015-05-06","rarity":"Common","number":"54","artist":"Kagemaru Himeno","img":"xy6/54"},{"id":"xy6-55","name":"Bagon","set":"Roaring Skies","date":"2015-05-06","rarity":"Common","number":"55","artist":"kirisAki","